      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TROUBLESOME (3) was below expectations on debut finishing fifth (25.95) at Ballarat. Better for the run and makes appeal this time. CLARKEY'S MATE (1) is a first starter from the Shona Crawford yard by Bernardo out of Accused. Drawn favourably and can capitalise. Expected to be well fancied and can make an immediate impact. HARROW TIME (2) showed ability on debut filling a minor placing when third (23.02) at Geelong over 400m. Expected to do much better this time. GALAXY OF LOVE (4) is a newcomer from the Dylan Sharp kennel. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Can sneak into the frame at her first appearance.",
